# PR completion — documentation checklist (Metal Dogs)

Metal Dogs is **main-only**. There is no product `dev` branch and no `docs/phase-*` working history in this repository. Do **not** run `scripts/promote-dev-to-main.sh` here (upstream Shopanda tooling).

## Before marking work done

1. Update **`docs/ROADMAP.md`** if a slice closed or a verify/inspect row changed.
2. Update architecture / ADR / runbook files touched by the change (see `docs/cr-rounds/README.md` closure checklist when closing a CR round).
3. Keep **`AGENTS.md`** build/test commands accurate when tooling lands.
4. Keep **`docs/UPSTREAM_PIN.md`** and upstream deviations in `docs/architecture/overview.md` accurate on Shopanda upgrades.
5. Do **not** vendor full upstream `docs/guides/*` or `docs/diagrams/*` files; link the pinned commit on GitHub or keep stub READMEs only.
6. Preserve fail-closed **`docs/GOVULN_BASELINE.md`** (empty allowlist is fine; deleting the file breaks CI).
7. Run locally before push when docs or CI scripts change:

```bash
bash .github/scripts/check-product-docs-links.sh
```

## Shopanda upstream PRs

If you are contributing **to Shopanda itself**, use Shopanda’s own `dev` / `docs/phase-*` checklist in that repository — not this file.
